OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASmall boat crosses Channel in
OL,4,A'uncontrolled landing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boat carrying 21 migrants made it all
OL,7,Fthe way across the English Channel
OL,8,Fwithout being intercepted in what is
OL,9,Fnow being classed by the Home Office as
OL,10,Fan "uncontrolled landing".
OL,12,FThe Home Office originally denied this
OL,13,Fwas the case and said the boat was met
OL,14,Fby awaiting officers in Dover, Kent, on
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FIn September, Home Secretary Shabana
OL,18,FMahmood described migrant landings on
OL,19,FUK beaches as "not acceptable" as she
OL,20,Fordered a review into two boats which
OL,21,Fhad reached Kent without being
OL,22,Fintercepted.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
