OL,3,GNEWSASmall boat crosses Channel in
OL,4,A'uncontrolled landing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it had made
OL,7,Fprogress tackling small boats and that
OL,8,Fcrossings were down "significantly"
OL,9,Fwith the lowest number of summer
OL,10,Farrivals being recorded since 2020.
